WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.132
Learn to use models to explain the result of addition and subtraction of decimals (up

00:00:05.132 --> 00:00:05.789
to hundredths)

00:00:06.617 --> 00:00:14.217
Calculate 0.40 plus 0.14. The answer is 0.54. Line up the decimal points and combine

00:00:14.217 --> 00:00:14.723
hundredths.

00:00:15.533 --> 00:00:21.985
Kofi cuts 2.7 m from a 6.0 m rope. What length remains? Pause and solve it in your

00:00:21.985 --> 00:00:22.701
exercise book.

00:00:23.533 --> 00:00:28.675
The answer is 3.3. Subtract: 6.0 minus 2.7 equals 3.3.
